pricepaid_check_price: inputSchema  parameters: +| medical: US only: dmepos = Medicare's fee schedule for medical equipment and supplies (wheelchairs, CPAP, oxygen, walkers, test strips). Leave out for doctor and hospital prices. -SE: a dental treatment +NO: a service in plain -SE: +NO: +NO: not used, leave out. -class, because Singapore +input.taxi_rate input.taxi_rate description: Parameter of the category (same name and meaning as in its own tool). transport-fares: IE only: standard (08:00-20:00 Mon-Sat, default), premium (20:00-08:00, Sundays and public holidays) or special (Sat/Sun 00:00-04:00, Christmas and New Year). +input.trading_h
pricepaid_home_sales: description, inputSchema  +Allegheny County, Pennsylvania (Pittsburgh area) (country US), +(country US), Detroit, Michigan  parameters: +DC, Maricopa County AZ and Allegheny County PA (Pittsburgh area) only; not nationwide; US = United States, partial: Connecticut, New York City, Cook County IL, Washington +only; not nationwide; US = United States, partial: Connecticut, New York City, Cook County IL, Washington DC, Maricopa County AZ, Allegheny County PA and Detroit MI +(Allegheny County, PA): rounded to the nearest of 3, 6, 12 or 24 (ZIP codes: 12 or 24). US +US (Detroit, MI): 1 to 36 months back from the latest sale in the table. +(Allegheny County, PA): a 5-digit ZIP code (15001 to 15290) with enough sales; 12 or 24 month w
pricepaid_home_sales_history: inputSchema  parameters: +DC, Maricopa County AZ and Allegheny County PA (Pittsburgh area) only; not nationwide; US = United States, partial: Connecticut, New York City, Cook County IL, Washington +only; not nationwide; US = United States, partial: Connecticut, New York City, Cook County IL, Washington DC, Maricopa County AZ, Allegheny County PA and Detroit MI +(Allegheny County, PA): a 5-digit ZIP code (15001 to 15290) with enough sales; 12 or 24 month windows only. US +US (Detroit, MI): optional ZIP code 48201 to 48288 with at least 5 sales in the window. +(Allegheny County, PA): not available, the County table has 
pricepaid_medical_prices: description, inputSchema  +Norway (state tariff fees for doctors, psychologists, dentists, physiotherapists) (country NO), -SG) +SG), the United States (Medicare fees for medical equipment) (country US) +Norway (state tariff fees for doctors, psychologists, dentists, physiotherapists): helsedirektoratet publishes new tariff files about twice a year; we read the page and use the newest file for each field; +(Medicare fees for medical equipment): quarterly (January, April, July, October); the release is stated in every answer; the United States  parameters: +input.basis input.basis description: US only: dmepos = Medicare's fee schedule for medical equipment and supplies (wheelchairs, CPAP, oxygen, walkers, test strips). Leave out for doctor and hospital prices. +NO = Norway (state tariff fees for doctors, psychologists, dentists and physiotherapists under the Helfo scheme, NOK; posted tariffs, not paid prices); +(basis=dmepos gives Medicare's fee-schedule amount for medical equipment and supplies such as wheelchairs, CPAP and oxygen, quarterly); US = United States -["SE", +["NO", "SE", +NO: a service in plain words ('consultation', 'cataract oper
pricepaid_transport_fares: description, inputSchema  +Prague (country CZ), +Ireland (taxi maximum fares) (country IE), +Prague: the feed is rebuilt daily by the publisher; fares change only when the tariff changes; +Ireland (taxi maximum fares): fixed by statutory instrument; in operation from 1 December 2024 and unchanged until the National Transport Authority makes a new Order;  parameters: +CZ = Czechia (Prague and the PID region only: the posted adult single ticket from the PID open fare table, CZK, a posted tariff); +IE = Ireland (taxi MAXIMUM metered fare for a journey distance, from the National Transport Authority's Order S.I. 479/2024, EUR, a regulated ceiling not an amount paid; no train, bus or Luas fares); +"CZ", +"IE", +Czechia (Prague): not used, one ticket price covers any distance inside the tariff zones. +Ireland (taxi): the journey distance in km (default 5); the maximum metered fare is worked out from the statutory tariff. +Czechia (Prague): only adult (default);
pricepaid_wholesale_power_price_history: inputSchema  parameters: +US: electricity only (California). -MWh) +MWh); US = California only (CAISO day-ahead market, hourly prices at three trading hubs, in US dollars per MWh, not euro) -"RO"] +"RO", "US"] +US: 1 to 14 days of hourly prices (default 7), plus tomorrow once published (about 13:00 Pacific); each delivery hour counts as one record. Prices are in US dollars (USD) per MWh, not euro. +US: day-ahead only (CAISO's hourly day-ahead market price); leave it out. +input.trading_hub input.trading_hub description: US only: CAISO trading hub NP15 (northern California, default), SP15 (southern) or ZP26 (central); 
pricepaid_wholesale_power_prices: description, inputSchema  -Japan +Japan, Romania -Romania: +California (United States): +minutes); California (United States): the next day's prices are published around 13:00 Pacific each day; read on each request (cached up to 30  parameters: +US: electricity only (California). -MWh) +MWh); US = California only (CAISO day-ahead market, hourly prices at three trading hubs, in US dollars per MWh, not euro) -"RO"] +"RO", "US"] +US: 1 to 14 days of hourly prices (default 7), plus tomorrow once published (about 13:00 Pacific); each delivery hour counts as one record. Prices are in US dollars (USD) per MWh, not euro. +US: day-ahead only (CAISO's hourly day-ahead market price); leave it out. +input.trading_hub input.trading_hub description: US only: CAISO trading hub NP15 (northern California, default), SP15 (southern) or ZP26 (central);
